(6) All plans must be to a scale no less than one (1) inch equals one hundred (100) feet;
(7) A location map;
(8) The name of the project;
(9) The name of the owner;
(10) Plant material list including the number and species of each type of tree to be installed; and
(11) Impervious surface area listed as a percent (%) of the lot.
(Ord. No. 43-09, § 1, 10-1-09)

